#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/liber_stock_shelves/models/stock_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Nothing would move: %(qty)s x %(product)s is picked from %(location)s and "
"stored back to %(location)s.\n"
"\n"
"Set the shelf the books leave from as the Source Location, or open Details "
"on the line and pick the stock of the warehouse root in \"Pick From\"."
msgstr ""
"Nada se move: %(qty)s x %(product)s sai de %(location)s e volta para "
"%(location)s.\n"
"\n"
"Ponha no Local de origem a prateleira de onde os livros saem, ou abra "
"Detalhes na linha e escolha em \"Separar de\" o estoque da raiz do armazém."

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/liber_stock_shelves/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"%(location)s is not a shelf of %(warehouse)s. An internal transfer moves "
"books between shelves of the warehouse; consignment shelves and other "
"locations are reached by their own operations."
msgstr ""
"%(location)s não é prateleira de %(warehouse)s. A transferência interna move "
"livros entre prateleiras do armazém; a prateleira de consignação e os outros "
"locais têm as suas próprias operações."

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/liber_stock_shelves/models/stock_quant_relocate.py:0
msgid ""
"%(location)s is not a warehouse shelf. Relocate moves books between shelves "
"of the warehouse; consignment shelves are reached by their own operations."
msgstr ""
"%(location)s não é prateleira do armazém. Realocar move livros entre "
"prateleiras do armazém; a prateleira de consignação tem as suas próprias "
"operações."

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:liber_stock_shelves.field_stock_move__shelf_from
msgid "Pick From"
msgstr "Separar de"

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:liber_stock_shelves.field_stock_move__shelf_from
msgid ""
"The locations the reservation picks from. On an internal transfer, if this "
"is the destination shelf, nothing will move: set the source shelf in the "
"Source Location."
msgstr ""
"Os locais de onde a reserva separa. Na transferência interna, se for a "
"prateleira de destino, nada vai se mover: ponha a prateleira de origem no "
"Local de origem."

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:liber_stock_shelves.field_stock_picking__is_shelf_transfer
msgid "Is Shelf Transfer"
msgstr "É transferência entre prateleiras"

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:liber_stock_shelves.field_stock_picking__is_shelf_transfer
msgid "Internal transfer of the warehouse itself (shelf to shelf)."
msgstr "Transferência interna do próprio armazém (prateleira a prateleira)."

#. module: liber_stock_shelves
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:liber_stock_shelves.field_stock_picking__shelf_warehouse_id
msgid "Shelf Warehouse"
msgstr "Armazém das prateleiras"

